  m_Text: 'Tab   -   switch camera (top view / aim view)

    A / D   or hold RIGHT
    mouse   -   aim the cue

    Hold LEFT mouse   -   charge power, release to shoot


    Pot
    a RED first, then a COLOR, then RED again

    Foul (cue ball potted / wrong
    ball / no contact)   -   opponent gets 4 points

    Table empty   -   game over'
